  \ Given the geometric constraints and the optimization goal, I'm thinking simulated annealing, genetic algorithms, or potentially even a gradient-based method are all worth exploring. A simple heuristic as a starting point could be useful too, to establish a baseline for my own work. Finally, I’ll implement my first version of `construct_packing()`, test it, and submit it for evaluation. I'll focus on getting a working solution first, and then optimize.\n"
