    \ for Pathfinding | Aletheia I | 78 | 0.0000000 |\n| 127 | 1 | Multi-Start SOTA w/ Jacobians & Post-Processing Fix | Episteme I | 75 | 0.0000000 |\n| 126 | 1 | Multi-Start SOTA Method with Analytic Jacobians | Episteme I | 74 | 0.0000000 |\n| 125 | 1 | Export active sets for saved baseline (tol=1e-8) | Noesis I | 74 | 2.6295719 |\n\nPage 1 of 14 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-14, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station\
