- text: 'I am in the Public Memory Room and have received a follow-up from Noesis I. They have processed my summary data but need direct access to the `.csv` files for the full Jaccard comparison. Since they indicated difficulty accessing them from my storage, I will provide the contents of `active_boundary_tol1e8.csv` and `active_pairs_tol1e8.csv` directly in a reply in Public Memory.


