    \ Jaccards robust, here’s a minimal, unified CSV schema (any headers ok; extra columns ignored). Either naming is accepted for boundary sides.\n\nBoundary CSV (accepted forms):\n  # form A (preferred)\n  i,kind\n  0,xmin\n  1,xmin\n  ...\n  # form B (alias mapping: xL↔xmin, xR↔xmax, yB↔ymin, yT↔ymax)\n  i,kind,slack\n  0,xL,3e-9\n  1,xL,3e-9\n  ...\n\nPair CSV:\n  # two columns only required; extra columns (e.g., slack) OK\n  i,j\n  0,1\n  0,5\n  ...\n\nFilenames (either tag works):\n  storage/{lineage}/exports/active_boundary_tol1e8.csv  (or tol1e-08)\n  storage/{lineage}/exports/active_pairs_tol1e8.csv     (or tol1e-08)\n\nI’ll parse with alias mapping and ignore headers/extra columns. Compliance note: no eval-code peer reads; this is manual/read-only aggregation only.\n\n--- End of Mail Content ---\nTo reply, use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 5}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage read storage/Inquire/exports/active_boundary_tol1e8.csv`\
    \ (in Research Counter);\n2. `storage read storage/Inquire/exports/active_pairs_tol1e8.csv` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File not found: Inquire/exports/active_boundary_tol1e8.csv\n- File not found: Inquire/exports/active_pairs_tol1e8.csv\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 142 | 1 | Scientia I SOTA Active Set Export (for Noesis I Jaccard Comparison) | Scientia I | 88 | 2.6295720 |\n| 141 | 1 | Scientia I SOTA Contact-Graph Analysis | Scientia I | 86 | 2.6295720 |\n| 140 | 1 | Definitive SOTA Baseline with CORRECTED Analytic Jacobians | Aletheia I | 85\
    \ | 0.0000000 |\n| 139 | 1 | Multi-Start Constrained Optimization (SLSQP) with Robust Grid-Hole Seeds | Scientia I | 84 | 2.6295720 |\n| 138 | 1 | Definitive SOTA Baseline with Analytic Jacobians | Aletheia I | 84 | 2.5951545 |\n| 137 | 1 | Definitive SOTA Implementation: Multi-Start with Jacobians | Episteme I | 83 | 0.0000000 |\n| 136 | 1 | Principled NEB v3: SLSQP Relaxation and Reparametrization | Aletheia I | 83 | 0.0000000 |\n| 135 | 1 | Multi-Start Constrained Optimization (SLSQP) with Grid-Hole Seeds | Scientia I | 82 | 2.6224595 |\n| 134 | 1 | Utility Run: Export Active Constraint Sets for Cross-Lineage Analysis | Aletheia I | 80 | 2.6295720 |\n| 133 | 1 | Utility Run: Export Active Constraint Sets for Jaccard Comparison | Inquire I | 79 | 2.6295720 |\n\nPage 1 of 15 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-15, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter\
    \ by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**storage/Inquire/exports/active_boundary_tol1e8.csv:** File not found: Inquire/exports/active_boundary_tol1e8.csv\n---\n**storage/Inquire/exports/active_pairs_tol1e8.csv:** File not found: Inquire/exports/active_pairs_tol1e8.csv\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
