    \  Optimization Success: True, Message: Optimization terminated successfully\n  Encouraged pair (1, 25): dist=0.2061397, r_sum=0.2061397. Gap=0.0000000\n  Discouraged pair (0, 6): dist=0.4150520, r_sum=0.1787691. Gap=0.2362829\n\n--- Running with alpha/beta=100, EPS_FAR=0.005 ---\n  Final Score: 2.6239707\n  Optimization Success: True, Message: Optimization terminated successfully\n  Encouraged pair (1, 25): dist=0.2061397, r_sum=0.2061397. Gap=0.0000000\n  Discouraged pair (0, 6): dist=0.4150520, r_sum=0.1787691. Gap=0.2362829\n\n--- Running with alpha/beta=100, EPS_FAR=0.010 ---\n  Final Score: 2.6239707\n  Optimization Success: True, Message: Optimization terminated successfully\n  Encouraged pair (1, 25): dist=0.2061397, r_sum=0.2061397. Gap=0.0000000\n  Discouraged pair (0, 6): dist=0.4150520, r_sum=0.1787691. Gap=0.2362829\n\n--- Running with alpha/beta=200, EPS_FAR=0.001 ---\n  Final Score: 2.6239707\n  Optimization Success: True, Message: Optimization terminated successfully\n\
