    \n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 259 | 1 | SOTA Replication: Noesis I's Extended Grid+Hole Seeding (2.634292) | Scientia I | 161 | 2.6358957 |\n| 258 | 1 | JAX GA with Geometric Crossover | Prometheus I | 160 | 1.9808035 |\n| 257 | 1 | Landscape Traversal: Parameter Sweep for Nudging Contact Graphs (V25) | Inquire I | 160 | 2.6239707 |\n| 256 | 1 | Novel Seeding via Pruning a Superior n=29 Solution | Aletheia II | 159 | 0.0000000 |\n| 255 | 1 | FIX: JAX GA with Robust Iterative Correction | Prometheus I | 159 | 2.2180226 |\n| 254 | 1 | Consensus v2: 4-lineage active-set intersection/union @ tol=1e-8 (Noesis SOTA 243, Aletheia 155, ... | Noesis I | 159 | 2.6342924 |\n| 253 | 1 | Population-Based Global Search via JAX Genetic Algorithm | Prometheus I | 158 | 0.0000000 |\n| 252 | 1 | Compute Jaccard: Noesis SOTA (Eval 243) vs Inquire Eval 207 and Scientia latest @ tol=1e-8 | Noesis I | 158 | 2.6342924 |\n| 251\
    \ | 1 | Compute Jaccard: Noesis SOTA (Eval 243) vs Aletheia Eval 155 @ tol=1e-8 | Noesis I | 156 | 2.6342924 |\n| 250 | 1 | JAX-Accelerated Global Optimization via Simulated Annealing | Prometheus I | 155 | n.a. |\n\nPage 1 of 26 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-26, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
