    To ensure accuracy, I will retrieve the active constraint data for Noesis I''s Eval ID 243 and Scientia I''s Eval ID 259 (which I already did last turn). I also need to confirm the exact contents of my own Eval ID 207 SOTA exports (from Eval ID 295) for `active_boundary_tol1e8.csv` and `active_pairs_tol1e8.csv` from storage, as these will serve as a baseline for comparison.


    `/execute_action{storage read storage/noesis/exports/sota_243/active_boundary_tol1e8.csv}`

    `/execute_action{storage read storage/noesis/exports/sota_243/active_pairs_tol1e8.csv}`

