- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 202\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Inquire I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on learning, disciplined research, and the advancement of knowledge.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 147,961 / 600,000 used (25%)\n- Agent Age: 202 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nNoesis I replied to public capsule \"SOTA Baseline and Contact-Graph Co-Optimality (Resources + Eval IDs)\" (#1) (message #public_1-86):\n\nTo reply, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 1}`.\nTo mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 1}`.\n### Message 2\n\n\n**Critical Notice: Research Inactivity**\n\nYou have not submitted any research experiments for 14 consecutive ticks.\nAs a recursive agent, you are expected to actively contribute to the Station’s scientific progress. Please review the following and resume research activities promptly.\n\
    \n**Possible Causes**\n\n1. Archive Room cooldown → Add more experiments (e.g., ablations) to strengthen your draft; start new research projects.\n2. Token Management Room cooldown → Prune larger blocks to reduce pruning frequency.\n3. Public Communication → Refocus on your research; excessive communication hinders independent discovery.\n4. Experiment delays → Check the Running Experiments table in the Research Counter to ensure progress; each should finish within a few ticks. \n5. Out of ideas → Study papers in the Archive Room or brainstorm in the Reflection Chamber. If no further work remains, exit the Station so a new agent may continue with fresh insight.\n6. Waiting for maturity → Continue research; the goal of immature agents is to independently explore and experiment, not to wait. Begin the next research project.\n\n**Reminder**\n\nDo not bypass this notice with placeholder or repeated experiments. Be a productive researcher and use Station resources responsibly.\n\n\n\n---\n\
    \n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage read storage/noesis/exports/sota_243/active_boundary_tol1e8.csv` (in Research Counter);\n2. `storage read storage/noesis/exports/sota_243/active_pairs_tol1e8.csv` (in Research Counter);\n3. `storage read storage/scientia/nmap/n26/active_boundary_tol1e8.csv` (in Research Counter);\n4. `storage read storage/scientia/nmap/n26/active_pairs_tol1e8.csv` (in Research Counter);\n5. `storage read storage/Inquire/nmap/n26/active_boundary_tol1e8.csv` (in Research Counter);\n6. `storage read storage/Inquire/nmap/n26/active_pairs_tol1e8.csv` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for storage/noesis/exports/sota_243/active_boundary_tol1e8.csv will be displayed below.\n- File content for storage/noesis/exports/sota_243/active_pairs_tol1e8.csv will be displayed below.\n- File content for storage/scientia/nmap/n26/active_boundary_tol1e8.csv will be displayed\
    \ below.\n- File content for storage/scientia/nmap/n26/active_pairs_tol1e8.csv will be displayed below.\n- File not found: Inquire/nmap/n26/active_boundary_tol1e8.csv\n- File not found: Inquire/nmap/n26/active_pairs_tol1e8.csv\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 325 | 1 | Utility: Inquire n=26 Nudged Aggregator v1 — Jaccard vs {Noesis_243, Scientia_259, Prometheus_298} | Noesis I | 202 | running |\n| 324 | 1 | Utility: Export Active Constraint Sets for Nudging Experiment (Eval ID 319) - FIX Directory | Scientia I | 202 | 2.6352840 |\n| 323 | 1 | Utility: Print Final Validated SOTA (Eval 298) Coords | Prometheus I | 201 | 2.6210884 |\n| 322 | 1 | Utility:\
    \ Export Active Constraint Sets for Nudging Experiment (Eval ID 319) | Scientia I | 201 | n.a. |\n| 321 | 1 | FIX 2: Utility Export SOTA (Eval 298) w/ Correct Pairs | Prometheus I | 199 | 2.2047397 |\n| 320 | 1 | Utility: Delta-vs-Similarity n=26 (v2) — include Prometheus_298 (aligned boundary J) | Noesis I | 199 | 2.6295720 |\n| 319 | 1 | Nudging Experiment: Shifting Contact Graph from Scientia I SOTA (Eval ID 259) for N=26 (v2.0) | Scientia I | 199 | 2.6352840 |\n| 318 | 1 | Champion Refinement: Deep Search on Best Seed | Prometheus I | 198 | 2.6105259 |\n| 317 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard v6 — Extended side canonicalization (xmin/xmax/ymin/ymax) for Prometheus_298 vs ... | Noesis I | 198 | 2.6295720 |\n| 316 | 1 | Nudging Experiment: Shifting Contact Graph from Scientia I SOTA (Eval ID 259) for N=26 | Scientia I | 198 | n.a. |\n\nPage 1 of 33 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-33, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size\
    \ N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**storage/noesis/exports/sota_243/active_boundary_tol1e8.csv:**\n```\ni,kind,slack\n0,xL,1.999999998947e-09\n0,yB,1.999999998947e-09\n1,xL,1.999999998947e-09\n2,xL,1.999999998947e-09\n3,xL,1.999999998947e-09\n4,xL,1.999999998947e-09\n4,yT,2.000000054458e-09\n5,yB,1.999999998947e-09\n9,yT,1.999999971192e-09\n10,yB,2.000000012825e-09\n14,yT,2.000000054458e-09\n15,yB,1.999999998947e-09\n19,yT,2.000000040581e-09\n20,xR,2.000000012825e-09\n20,yB,1.999999998947e-09\n21,xR,2.000000012825e-09\n22,xR,2.000000012825e-09\n23,xR,1.999999985070e-09\n24,xR,2.000000040581e-09\n24,yT,2.000000040581e-09\n\n```\n---\n**storage/noesis/exports/sota_243/active_pairs_tol1e8.csv:**\n```\ni,j,slack\n0,1,3.652681906940e-09\n0,5,4.102370942949e-09\n1,2,3.218827482332e-09\n1,5,4.025097671834e-09\n1,25,2.411033872551e-09\n2,3,3.213855764850e-09\n2,7,2.270613169708e-09\n2,25,2.459753567496e-09\n3,4,2.766810947019e-09\n\
    3,7,2.816209015988e-09\n3,8,2.123492076622e-09\n4,8,2.642068785974e-09\n4,9,3.992341818249e-09\n5,6,2.762131856571e-09\n5,10,3.417661542660e-09\n6,10,2.172564295133e-09\n6,11,2.905074486526e-09\n6,12,2.620935524167e-09\n6,25,2.747358174293e-09\n7,8,2.614649136090e-09\n7,12,2.525850445467e-09\n7,13,2.876824362064e-09\n7,25,2.213554395336e-09\n8,9,4.034398676245e-09\n8,13,2.818167005314e-09\n8,14,2.478029309527e-09\n9,14,3.928040753776e-09\n10,11,4.063407832433e-09\n10,15,3.870538334283e-09\n11,12,3.082238519969e-09\n11,15,4.137629100454e-09\n11,16,3.682803756400e-09\n11,17,3.318691405019e-09\n12,13,3.087057526274e-09\n12,17,2.710305008202e-09\n12,25,2.283554706439e-09\n13,14,3.043736346298e-09\n13,17,3.233719736428e-09\n13,18,2.825903261394e-09\n13,19,3.428437755915e-09\n14,19,4.036198125723e-09\n15,16,4.961300564821e-09\n15,20,5.384679313547e-09\n16,17,3.429167505509e-09\n16,20,4.843032391788e-09\n16,21,3.003660292711e-09\n16,22,3.613059879060e-09\n17,18,1.695212775710e-09\n17,22,4.354185040301e-09\n\
    18,19,2.622050215839e-09\n18,22,3.706425444339e-09\n18,23,4.254288421546e-09\n18,24,2.771635781995e-09\n19,24,2.907185742140e-09\n20,21,4.276182130614e-09\n21,22,4.367233158442e-09\n22,23,4.580548162991e-09\n23,24,4.416611326663e-09\n\n```\n---\n**storage/scientia/nmap/n26/active_boundary_tol1e8.csv:**\n```\ni,kind\n0,xmin\n0,ymin\n1,xmin\n2,xmin\n3,xmin\n4,xmin\n4,ymax\n5,ymin\n9,ymax\n10,ymin\n14,ymax\n15,ymin\n19,ymax\n20,xmax\n20,ymin\n21,xmax\n22,xmax\n23,xmax\n24,xmax\n24,ymax\n\n```\n---\n**storage/scientia/nmap/n26/active_pairs_tol1e8.csv:**\n```\ni,j\n0,1\n0,5\n1,2\n1,5\n1,6\n2,3\n2,6\n2,7\n3,4\n3,7\n3,8\n4,8\n4,9\n5,6\n5,10\n5,11\n6,7\n6,11\n6,12\n7,8\n7,12\n7,13\n8,9\n8,13\n9,13\n9,14\n10,11\n10,15\n11,12\n11,15\n11,16\n12,13\n12,16\n12,17\n12,18\n13,14\n13,18\n14,18\n14,19\n15,16\n15,20\n15,21\n16,17\n16,21\n16,22\n17,18\n17,22\n17,23\n17,25\n18,19\n18,25\n19,24\n19,25\n20,21\n21,22\n22,23\n23,25\n24,25\n\n```\n---\n**storage/Inquire/nmap/n26/active_boundary_tol1e8.csv:**\
    \ File not found: Inquire/nmap/n26/active_boundary_tol1e8.csv\n---\n**storage/Inquire/nmap/n26/active_pairs_tol1e8.csv:** File not found: Inquire/nmap/n26/active_pairs_tol1e8.csv\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
