    \n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage write storage/Inquire/nmap/n26/Nudged_4_ID285_R4/Nudged_4_ID285_R4_radii_tol1e8.txt` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n2. `storage write storage/Inquire/nmap/n26/Nudged_4_ID285_R4/Nudged_4_ID285_R4_active_boundary_tol1e8.csv` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n3. `storage write storage/Inquire/nmap/n26/Nudged_4_ID285_R4/Nudged_4_ID285_R4_active_pairs_tol1e8.csv` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n4. `storage write storage/Inquire/nmap/n26/Nudged_4_ID285_R4/Nudged_4_ID285_R4_summary_tol1e8.json` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File created successfully: inquire/nmap/n26/Nudged_4_ID285_R4/Nudged_4_ID285_R4_radii_tol1e8.txt\n- File created successfully: inquire/nmap/n26/Nudged_4_ID285_R4/Nudged_4_ID285_R4_active_boundary_tol1e8.csv\n- File created successfully: inquire/nmap/n26/Nudged_4_ID285_R4/Nudged_4_ID285_R4_active_pairs_tol1e8.csv\n\
    - File created successfully: inquire/nmap/n26/Nudged_4_ID285_R4/Nudged_4_ID285_R4_summary_tol1e8.json\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 410 | 1 | Ingest Inquire Nudged n=26 sets (glob‑tolerant) and compute Jaccards @ tol=1e-8 | Noesis I | 245 | running |\n| 409 | 1 | Exhaustive Local Search: Exploring Scientia I Distinct Structural Basin (Eval ID 375 Base) with E... | Scientia I | 245 | 2.6071967 |\n| 408 | 1 | Ingest Inquire Nudged n=26 sets and compute Jaccards @ tol=1e-8 | Noesis I | 244 | 2.5411713 |\n| 407 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=52 | Aletheia II | 243 | 0.0000000 |\n| 406 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak\
    \ Search for n=51 | Aletheia II | 241 | 0.0000000 |\n| 405 | 1 | Nudging Experiment 1 (FIX): Analytic Jacobian | Prometheus I | 240 | 2.6210884 |\n| 404 | 1 | Compute Jaccards FIX3: map xL/xR/yB/yT → xmin/xmax/ymin/ymax; accept 'kind' header | Noesis I | 240 | 2.5411713 |\n| 403 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=50 | Aletheia II | 239 | 0.0000000 |\n| 402 | 1 | Nudging Experiment 1: Discourage (0, 5) Contact from SOTA | Prometheus I | 239 | n.a. |\n| 401 | 1 | Compute Jaccards FIX2: boundary header synonyms + tol1e08 fallback | Noesis I | 239 | 2.5411713 |\n\nPage 1 of 41 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-41, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help\
    \ room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
