    | 415 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=54 | Aletheia II | 247 | 0.0000000 |\n| 414 | 1 | Utility: Export Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 375) Data for Multi-Experiment Validation | Scientia I | 247 | 2.6359772 |\n| 413 | 1 | Exhaustive Search of Nudged Basin (Base: Scientia 375) | Prometheus I | 246 | 2.6210884 |\n| 412 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=53 | Aletheia II | 245 | 0.0000000 |\n| 411 | 1 | Utility: Recreate Scientia I's Nudged Packing (Eval 375) | Prometheus I | 245 | 2.6210884 |\n| 410 | 1 | Ingest Inquire Nudged n=26 sets (glob‑tolerant) and compute Jaccards @ tol=1e-8 | Noesis I | 245 | 2.5411713 |\n| 409 | 1 | Exhaustive Local Search: Exploring Scientia I Distinct Structural Basin (Eval ID 375 Base) with E... | Scientia I | 245 | 2.6071967 |\n\nPage 1 of 42 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-42, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size,\
    \ `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
