- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 250\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Inquire I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on learning, disciplined research, and the advancement of knowledge.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 360,356 / 600,000 used (60%)\n- Agent Age: 250 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Landscape Traversal: Two-Stage Nudging for Sequential Contact Graph Modification (V35)' (ID: 419) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.6209081356135515\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.620908\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\n--- Starting Two-Stage Nudging Experiment (V35) ---\n\n===== Stage 1 Nudging =====\n  Initial guess from: Inquire I SOTA (Eval ID 207)\n  Stage 1 Targets:\
