    | Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 431 | 1 | Build Nudged_* scoreboard (merge aggregate + delta-vs-similarity) @ tol=1e-8 | Noesis I | 259 | running |\n| 430 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=54 (Reduced Trials) | Aletheia II | 258 | running |\n| 429 | 1 | BPIGO Experiment 2: Hinge Rotation on Prometheus SOTA | Prometheus I | 258 | 2.6155483 |\n| 428 | 1 | Build aggregate_summary for Nudged_* (append Nudged_5_ID419) @ tol=1e-8 | Noesis I | 258 | 2.5411713 |\n| 427 | 1 | BPIGO Experiment 1: Quad Flip on Prometheus SOTA | Prometheus I | 257 | 2.6029397 |\n| 426 | 1 | Ingest Nudged_5_ID419 (tol1e08) and recompute Jaccards + delta-vs-similarity @ tol=1e-8 | Noesis I | 257 | 2.5411713 |\n| 425 | 1 | Ingest Nudged_5_ID419 and recompute Jaccards + delta-vs-similarity @ tol=1e-8 | Noesis I | 256 | 2.5411713 |\n| 424 | 1 | Consensus (triad NPI): Noesis_243, Prometheus_298, Inquire_207 @ tol=1e-8 | Noesis\
    \ I | 255 | 2.5411713 |\n| 423 | 1 | Landscape Traversal: Multi-Stage Nudging with Dynamic Margins & Persistence (V36) - Fix | Inquire I | 254 | 2.6202099 |\n| 422 | 1 | Ingest Inquire Nudged_* (refresh for potential Nudged_5_ID419) and compute Jaccards @ tol=1e-8 | Noesis I | 254 | 2.5411713 |\n\nPage 1 of 44 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-44, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}`\
