    \ then `/execute_action{mute 1}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML parsing error encountered: YAML parsing error for 'submit': while scanning a simple key\n  in \"<unicode string>\", line 75, column 1:\n    24,yT\n    ^\ncould not find expected ':'\n  in \"<unicode string>\", line 76, column 1:\n    0,yB\n    ^. Guidance: 1. Place YAML immediately on next line after action. 2. Start with ```yaml and end with ``` on a new line. 3. When using multi-line content with |, ensure all lines are indented with two spaces.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Submission requires YAML data with 'title', 'tags', 'abstract', and 'content' fields.\n- Note on action 'submit': YAML parsing error for 'submit': while scanning a simple key\n  in \"<unicode string>\", line 75, column 1:\n    24,yT\n    ^\ncould not find expected ':'\n  in \"<unicode string>\", line 76, column 1:\n\
    \    0,yB\n    ^\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 432 | 1 | Nudged_* correlation analysis: pairs Jaccard vs ΔΣr @ tol=1e-8 | Noesis I | 260 | running |\n| 431 | 1 | Build Nudged_* scoreboard (merge aggregate + delta-vs-similarity) @ tol=1e-8 | Noesis I | 259 | 2.5411713 |\n| 430 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=54 (Reduced Trials) | Aletheia II | 258 | 0.0000000 |\n| 429 | 1 | BPIGO Experiment 2: Hinge Rotation on Prometheus SOTA | Prometheus I | 258 | 2.6155483 |\n| 428 | 1 | Build aggregate_summary for Nudged_* (append Nudged_5_ID419) @ tol=1e-8 | Noesis I | 258 | 2.5411713 |\n| 427 | 1 | BPIGO Experiment 1: Quad Flip on Prometheus\
    \ SOTA | Prometheus I | 257 | 2.6029397 |\n| 426 | 1 | Ingest Nudged_5_ID419 (tol1e08) and recompute Jaccards + delta-vs-similarity @ tol=1e-8 | Noesis I | 257 | 2.5411713 |\n| 425 | 1 | Ingest Nudged_5_ID419 and recompute Jaccards + delta-vs-similarity @ tol=1e-8 | Noesis I | 256 | 2.5411713 |\n| 424 | 1 | Consensus (triad NPI): Noesis_243, Prometheus_298, Inquire_207 @ tol=1e-8 | Noesis I | 255 | 2.5411713 |\n| 423 | 1 | Landscape Traversal: Multi-Stage Nudging with Dynamic Margins & Persistence (V36) - Fix | Inquire I | 254 | 2.6202099 |\n\nPage 1 of 44 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-44, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help\
    \ research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
