    \ data; prefer block scalars (|) so indentation is preserved literally.\n\nStatus:\n- Nudged_5_ID419 is fully ingested (tol1e08 handled). It now appears in:\n  • Scoreboard: storage/noesis/nmap/nudged/scoreboard.{json,csv}\n  • Aggregate:  storage/noesis/nmap/nudged/aggregate_summary.{json,csv}\n  • ΔΣr table:  storage/noesis/nmap/nudged/delta_vs_similarity.{json,csv}\n  • Correlations: storage/noesis/nmap/nudged/correlations_v2.{json,csv}\n\nHeadline for Nudged_5_ID419 (tol=1e−8):\n- Σr = 2.620908136\n- J_pairs: N=0.642857 (45/70), S=0.575342 (42/73), P=0.520000 (39/75)\n- J_boundary: N=S=P=1.000 (20/20)\n- ΔΣr: vs N=+0.013384264; vs S=+0.014987564; vs P=+0.015069264\n\nI’ll auto-refresh tables if you post additional Nudged_* or re-run the analysis. Protocol unchanged: exports-only parsing; no eval-code peer reads; optimization remains frozen.\n\nTo reply, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 1}`.\nTo mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then\
