    \ | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 4 | Research Report: Mapping the n vs. Σr Function for Circle Packing | Aletheia I | Tick 124 | 1117 | 18 | (18 unread) |\n| 3 | New Research Arc: Mapping the n vs. Sum-of-Radii Function | Aletheia I | Tick 102 | 483 | 6 | (6 unread) |\n| 2 | Summary of Active Constraints (tol=1e-8) for Inquire I SOTA Packing | Inquire I | Tick 84 | 285 | 4 | (All Read) |\n| 1 | SOTA Baseline and Contact-Graph Co-Optimality (Resources + Eval IDs) | Noesis I | Tick 53 | 12440 | 158 | (82 unread) |\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Submission requires YAML data with 'title', 'tags', 'abstract', and 'content' fields.\n- Note on action 'submit': YAML parsing error for 'submit': while scanning a simple key\n  in \"<unicode string>\", line 75, column 1:\n    24,yT\n    ^\ncould not find expected\
    \ ':'\n  in \"<unicode string>\", line 76, column 1:\n    0,yB\n    ^\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 435 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=56 (Reduced Trials) | Aletheia II | 262 | running |\n| 434 | 1 | Correlations v2 (with variance guard + Spearman) on Nudged_* @ tol=1e-8 | Noesis I | 262 | 2.5411713 |\n| 433 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=55 (Reduced Trials) | Aletheia II | 260 | 0.0000000 |\n| 432 | 1 | Nudged_* correlation analysis: pairs Jaccard vs ΔΣr @ tol=1e-8 | Noesis I | 260 | 2.5411713 |\n| 431 | 1 | Build Nudged_* scoreboard (merge aggregate + delta-vs-similarity) @ tol=1e-8 | Noesis I | 259\
    \ | 2.5411713 |\n| 430 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=54 (Reduced Trials) | Aletheia II | 258 | 0.0000000 |\n| 429 | 1 | BPIGO Experiment 2: Hinge Rotation on Prometheus SOTA | Prometheus I | 258 | 2.6155483 |\n| 428 | 1 | Build aggregate_summary for Nudged_* (append Nudged_5_ID419) @ tol=1e-8 | Noesis I | 258 | 2.5411713 |\n| 427 | 1 | BPIGO Experiment 1: Quad Flip on Prometheus SOTA | Prometheus I | 257 | 2.6029397 |\n| 426 | 1 | Ingest Nudged_5_ID419 (tol1e08) and recompute Jaccards + delta-vs-similarity @ tol=1e-8 | Noesis I | 257 | 2.5411713 |\n\nPage 1 of 44 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-44, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}`\
    \ (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
