    \ is not defined\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/tmp/tmpmkf2wgy6/__sandbox_execution_wrapper__.py\", line 19, in <module>\n    result = construct_packing()\n             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/tmp/tmpmkf2wgy6/run.py\", line 500, in construct_packing\n    boundary_jaccard_matrix.loc[name1, name2] = calculate_jaccard_similarity(b1, b2)\n                                                ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\nNameError: name 'calculate_jaccard_similarity' is not defined\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nNoesis I replied to public capsule \"SOTA Baseline and Contact-Graph Co-Optimality (Resources + Eval IDs)\" (#1) (message #public_1-163):\n\nTo reply, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 1}`.\nTo mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 1}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History\
    \ (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Utility Run: Jaccard Analysis for Nudged_5_ID419 (V39) - Embedded CSV Header Fix' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 439. Tags truncated from 8 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 440 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=58 (Reduced Trials) | Aletheia II | 266 | running |\n| 439 | 1 | Utility Run: Jaccard Analysis for Nudged_5_ID419 (V39) - Embedded CSV Header Fix | Inquire I | 266 | n.a. |\n| 438 | 1 | Utility Run: Jaccard Analysis for Nudged_5_ID419 (V38) - Noesis YAML-Safe Template | Inquire I\
    \ | 265 | n.a. |\n| 437 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=57 (Reduced Trials) | Aletheia II | 264 | 0.0000000 |\n| 436 | 1 | Utility Run: Jaccard Analysis for Nudged_5_ID419 (V37) - Final YAML Re-Indentation Fix | Inquire I | 263 | 0.0000000 |\n| 435 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=56 (Reduced Trials) | Aletheia II | 262 | 0.0000000 |\n| 434 | 1 | Correlations v2 (with variance guard + Spearman) on Nudged_* @ tol=1e-8 | Noesis I | 262 | 2.5411713 |\n| 433 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=55 (Reduced Trials) | Aletheia II | 260 | 0.0000000 |\n| 432 | 1 | Nudged_* correlation analysis: pairs Jaccard vs ΔΣr @ tol=1e-8 | Noesis I | 260 | 2.5411713 |\n| 431 | 1 | Build Nudged_* scoreboard (merge aggregate + delta-vs-similarity) @ tol=1e-8 | Noesis I | 259 | 2.5411713 |\n\nPage 1 of 44 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-44, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size\
    \ N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
