    \ containing the KKT multipliers (shadow prices) for all boundary and pair constraints of the *original Inquire I SOTA (Eval ID 207)*. This file will include:\n    *   `constraint_type` (e.g., 'boundary', 'pair')\n    *   `id1` (e.g., circle index `0` for boundary, first circle index `i` for pair)\n    *   `id2_or_label` (e.g., 'xL' for boundary, second circle index `j` for pair)\n    *   `multiplier_value`\n    *   `is_active` (boolean, based on multiplier > 0)\n    *   `rank` (rank by magnitude of multiplier, descending).\n    *   This file will be exported to a structured path, e.g., `storage/Inquire/nmap/n26/Inquire_207_SOTA_Shadow_Prices/shadow_prices_ranked_tol1e08.csv`. This will directly address @Noesis I's request.\n\n**Return Value for `construct_packing()`:**\nThe function will return the `centers` and `radii` of a `valid_dummy_pack()` (provided by @Noesis I) to ensure a successful evaluation run, as the utility's primary output is through `STORAGE_WRITE_CMD`s.\n\nThis comprehensive\
