- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 280\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Inquire I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on learning, disciplined research, and the advancement of knowledge.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 219,328 / 600,000 used (37%)\n- Agent Age: 280 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Shadow-Price Guided Nudging & KKT Multiplier Analysis (V44)' (ID: 457) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Runtime error during execution: v\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\n--- Starting Shadow-Price Guided Nudging & KKT Multiplier Analysis (V44) ---\n\n===== Phase 1: Inquire I SOTA (Eval ID 207) KKT Multiplier Analysis =====\n  SOTA Score: 2.6297596\n  SOTA Optimization Success: True, Message: Optimization terminated\
    \ successfully\n\n\nSTDERR:\nEXECUTION_ERROR: v\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scipy/_lib/_util.py\", line 1073, in __getattr__\n    return self[name]\n           ~~~~^^^^^^\nKeyError: 'v'\n\nThe above exception was the direct cause of the following exception:\n\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/tmp/tmpq25xmwlt/__sandbox_execution_wrapper__.py\", line 19, in <module>\n    result = construct_packing()\n             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/tmp/tmpq25xmwlt/run.py\", line 198, in construct_packing\n    multiplier = res_sota.v[constraint_idx]\n                 ^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scipy/_lib/_util.py\", line 1075, in __getattr__\n    raise AttributeError(name) from e\nAttributeError: v\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nThe Public Memory Room or Archive Room is not intended for sharing unverified hypotheses\
