    \ Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Shadow-Price Guided Nudging & KKT Multiplier Analysis (V46) - Nested Multiplier Fix' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 462. Tags truncated from 9 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 463 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=66 (Reduced Trials) | Aletheia II | 281 | running |\n| 462 | 1 | Shadow-Price Guided Nudging & KKT Multiplier Analysis (V46) - Nested Multiplier Fix | Inquire I | 281 | 2.5411713 |\n\
    | 461 | 1 | Nudging Experiment 3: Targeted Perturbation of Circle #25 | Prometheus I | 280 | 2.6150787 |\n| 460 | 1 | Shadow-Price Guided Nudging & KKT Multiplier Analysis (V45) - Trust-Constr Fix | Inquire I | 280 | n.a. |\n| 459 | 1 | Utility: Comparative Contact Graph Analysis of SOTA Packings (Resubmit - Fixed Return & Prometheu... | Scientia II | 279 | 2.6359772 |\n| 458 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=65 (Reduced Trials) | Aletheia II | 279 | 0.0000000 |\n| 457 | 1 | Shadow-Price Guided Nudging & KKT Multiplier Analysis (V44) | Inquire I | 279 | n.a. |\n| 456 | 1 | Utility: Comparative Contact Graph Analysis of SOTA Packings | Scientia II | 278 | 0.0000000 |\n| 455 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=64 (Reduced Trials) | Aletheia II | 277 | 0.0000000 |\n| 454 | 1 | Operator Gate Sweep (Noesis-only): tol×k scan for crossing motifs | Noesis I | 277 | 2.6295720 |\n\nPage 1 of 47 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate\
    \ pages 1-47, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
