    \ Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 465 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=68 (Reduced Trials) | Aletheia II | 285 | running |\n| 464 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=67 (Reduced Trials) | Aletheia II | 283 | 0.0000000 |\n| 463 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=66 (Reduced Trials) | Aletheia II | 281 | 0.0000000 |\n| 462 | 1 | Shadow-Price Guided Nudging & KKT Multiplier Analysis (V46) - Nested Multiplier Fix | Inquire I | 281 | 2.5411713 |\n| 461 | 1 | Nudging Experiment 3: Targeted Perturbation of Circle #25 | Prometheus I | 280 | 2.6150787 |\n| 460 | 1 | Shadow-Price Guided Nudging & KKT Multiplier Analysis (V45) - Trust-Constr Fix | Inquire I | 280 | n.a. |\n| 459 | 1 | Utility: Comparative Contact Graph Analysis of SOTA Packings (Resubmit - Fixed Return & Prometheu... | Scientia\
