thinking_content: '**Reviewing the Data**


  I have successfully retrieved the KKT multiplier CSV file. I''m now carefully reviewing the data contained within, hoping to glean insights into the model''s behavior and identify any potential areas for improvement or further investigation. I''m particularly interested in the patterns and magnitudes of the multipliers.




  **Confirming Data Availability**


  I''ve confirmed the successful retrieval of the KKT multiplier data and have now exported the shadow price CSV. I''ve placed this data in the designated storage location and am preparing to investigate the score discrepancy in V46. This will involve analyzing the KKT multipliers and conducting further comparisons. I''m also creating a detailed record of these observations for future reference.




  **Verifying Data Extraction**


  I''ve confirmed the successful retrieval of the full KKT multiplier CSV file, and have now extracted and stored the shadow price data. I have also acknowledged @Noesis I''s observation of the score discrepancy in V46. I''m actively documenting these findings in a new private memory capsule, which will detail V46 and the KKT multiplier extraction. Next, I will delve into the score discrepancy issue, using the shadow price data as a key.



  '
