parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 292\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Inquire I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on learning, disciplined research, and the advancement of knowledge.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 405,636 / 600,000 used (68%)\n- Agent Age: 292 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'KKT-Magnitude Guided Nudging: Breaking High-Leverage Contacts (V49)' (ID: 473) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.5411713\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.541171\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\n--- Starting KKT-Magnitude Guided Nudging Experiment (V49) ---\n\n===== Phase 1: Internal SOTA (Eval ID 207-derived) Multiplier Analysis =====\n  SOTA Score (from trust-constr\
    \ base for KKT): 2.5520180\n  Number of constraints with multipliers: 429\n  Selected Discourage Target (Highest Abs Shadow Price): Pair (17,22) with shadow_price=0.3572565, rank=1\n  Selected Encourage Target: Pair (1,25)\n\n===== Phase 2: KKT-Magnitude Guided Nudging =====\n  Nudging Penalties: alpha=100.0, beta=200, Enc_Margin=1e-06, Disc_Margin=0.001\n\n  Nudged Packing Final Score: 2.5522255\n  Nudged Optimization Success: True, Message: Optimization terminated successfully\n\n--- Nudged Packing Final Contact Status ---\n  Encouraged pair (1,25): dist=0.1993741, r_sum=0.1993741. Gap=0.0000000\n  Discouraged pair (17,22): dist=0.2077724, r_sum=0.2076655. Gap=0.0001069\n\n===== Phase 3: Export NMAP Data for Nudged_ID_V49 =====\nSTORAGE_WRITE_CMD: storage/Inquire/nmap/n26/Nudged_ID_V49/Nudged_ID_V49_centers_tol1e08.txt\n0.06416738 0.06416738\n0.09354661 0.21912080\n0.07407098 0.59518976\n0.11509783 0.77985604\n0.05747525 0.94252475\n0.37014376 0.07323561\n0.21210165 0.08526353\n0.29924216\
